<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Liton Jan-Sept profit rises.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Liton Jan-Sept profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Liton Electronic said on Wednesday its combined net profit from January to September in 1996 rose to T$593 million from T$530 million in the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>The company's sales revenue for the first nine months also rose to T$7.653 billion from T$6.6 billion in the same 1995 period, a spokesman said by telephone.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
